## FastAPI on AWS Lambda

### Deployment Options

Match the repo's pattern: **SAM** or **Serverless Framework** — do not switch mid-project unless the spec asks.

### Lambda Handler Pattern

Use **Mangum** adapter to convert ASGI (FastAPI) to Lambda event format:

```python
# lambda_handler.py
from mangum import Mangum
from app.main import app

handler = Mangum(
    app,
    lifespan="off"  # Disable lifespan events for Lambda
)
```

---

### Option 1: AWS SAM (Serverless Application Model)

**File:** `template.yaml`

```yaml
AWSTemplateFormatVersion: "2010-09-09"
Transform: AWS::Serverless-2016-10-31

Description: FastAPI Lambda API

Globals:
  Function:
    Runtime: python3.12
    Timeout: 30
    MemorySize: 1024
    Architectures:
      - x86_64
    Environment:
      Variables:
        ENVIRONMENT: !Ref Environment
        DYNAMODB_TABLE: !Ref OrdersTable

Parameters:
  Environment:
    Type: String
    Default: dev
    AllowedValues: [dev, staging, prod]

Resources:
  # API Gateway
  ApiGateway:
    Type: AWS::Serverless::Api
    Properties:
      StageName: !Ref Environment
      Cors:
        AllowMethods: "'GET,POST,PUT,DELETE,OPTIONS'"
        AllowHeaders: "'*'"
        AllowOrigin: "'*'"

  # Lambda Function
  FastApiFunction:
    Type: AWS::Serverless::Function
    Properties:
      FunctionName: !Sub 'risk-api-${Environment}'
      Handler: lambda_handler.handler
      CodeUri: .
      Policies:
        - DynamoDBCrudPolicy:
            TableName: !Ref OrdersTable
        - S3CrudPolicy:
            BucketName: !Ref DataBucket
      Events:
        Root:
          Type: Api
          Properties:
            RestApiId: !Ref ApiGateway
            Path: /
            Method: ANY
        Proxy:
          Type: Api
          Properties:
            RestApiId: !Ref ApiGateway
            Path: /{proxy+}
            Method: ANY

  # DynamoDB Table
  OrdersTable:
    Type: AWS::DynamoDB::Table
    Properties:
      TableName: !Sub 'orders-${Environment}'
      BillingMode: PAY_PER_REQUEST
      AttributeDefinitions:
        - AttributeName: PK
          AttributeType: S
        - AttributeName: SK
          AttributeType: S
      KeySchema:
        - AttributeName: PK
          KeyType: HASH
        - AttributeName: SK
          KeyType: RANGE

  # S3 Bucket
  DataBucket:
    Type: AWS::S3::Bucket
    Properties:
      BucketName: !Sub 'risk-data-${Environment}'
      PublicAccessBlockConfiguration:
        BlockPublicAcls: true
        BlockPublicPolicy: true
        IgnorePublicAcls: true
        RestrictPublicBuckets: true

Outputs:
  ApiUrl:
    Description: API Endpoint
    Value: !Sub "https://${ApiGateway}.execute-api.${AWS::Region}.amazonaws.com/${Environment}/"
  
  FunctionArn:
    Description: Lambda Function ARN
    Value: !GetAtt FastApiFunction.Arn
```

**Commands:**
```bash
# Build
sam build

# Deploy (first time)
sam deploy --guided

# Deploy (subsequent)
sam deploy --parameter-overrides Environment=prod

# Test locally
sam local start-api
curl http://localhost:3000/health

# Tail logs
sam logs -n FastApiFunction --tail

# Delete stack
sam delete
```

