### Deployment Comparison

| Feature | SAM | Serverless Framework |
|---------|-----|----------------------|
| **Language** | YAML (CloudFormation) | YAML (simpler syntax) |
| **Learning Curve** | Moderate | Easy |
| **Local Testing** | `sam local start-api` | `serverless offline` |
| **Plugin Ecosystem** | Limited | Extensive |
| **AWS Integration** | Native (AWS) | Third-party |
| **Multi-cloud** | AWS only | AWS, Azure, GCP |
| **Layer Support** | Manual | Automatic (`serverless-python-requirements`) |
| **Cost** | Free (AWS tool) | Free (open source) |
| **Best For** | AWS-native projects | Multi-cloud, fast iteration |

**Recommendation:**
- Use **SAM** if staying within AWS ecosystem and want native CloudFormation integration
- Use **Serverless Framework** if need faster iteration, better DX, or multi-cloud support

