## Anti-Patterns

❌ **No type hints** → ✅ Type all function signatures  
❌ **Globals for request state** → ✅ Use `Depends()`  
❌ **Bare `Any` everywhere** → ✅ Use proper types  
❌ **N+1 queries** → ✅ Use eager loading (`selectinload`, `joinedload`)  
❌ **Secrets in code** → ✅ Use Secrets Manager / SSM  
❌ **SQL injection** → ✅ Use bound parameters  
❌ **No error handling** → ✅ Use `HTTPException` with proper status codes  
❌ **No tests** → ✅ Write unit + integration tests (>80% coverage)  
❌ **Breaking migrations** → ✅ Multi-step backward-compatible migrations  
❌ **Wildcard IAM permissions** → ✅ Least-privilege policies
